      "refersTo": "plan-list-row",
      "description": "Aprende: a topic with its MasteryBadge and evidence; the current one carries the Siguiente tag.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-list\"><li class=\"ds-topic is-current\"><span class=\"ds-topic-l\">Proporciones <span class=\"ds-tag\">Siguiente</span></span><span class=\"ds-meta\"><span class=\"ds-badge\"><b></b><b></b><s></s><s></s>Familiar</span>7 de 10 bien</span></li><li class=\"ds-topic\"><span class=\"ds-topic-l\">Probabilidad</span><span class=\"ds-meta\"><span class=\"ds-badge\"><b></b><s></s><s></s><s></s>Intentado</span>2 de 5 bien</span></li></ul>",
      "css": ".ds-list{font-family:Figtree,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;border:1px solid rgba(16,35,28,0.13);border-radius:16px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;color:#10231c}.ds-topic{display:grid;gap:.375rem;padding:.75rem 1rem;min-height:2.75rem}.ds-topic+.ds-topic{border-top:1px solid rgba(16,35,28,0.13)}.ds-topic.is-current{background:color-mix(in srgb,#ffd23f 16%,#fff)}.ds-topic-l{display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;font-weight:700}.ds-tag{padding:.125rem .5rem;border-radius:999px;background:#ffd23f;color:#10231c;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:800}.ds-meta{display:flex;gap:.875rem;align-items:center;color:#52665d;font-size:.8125rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:2px;color:#10231c;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:600}.ds-badge b,.ds-badge s{display:inline-block;width:3px;height:6px;background:#097d52}.ds-badge s{background:rgba(16,35,28,0.24)}.ds-badge :nth-child(4){margin-right:.375rem}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Area Band",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Aprende and lesson cover: the area colour as a header band with level and bar.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-band\"><div class=\"ds-band-top\"><h2>Matemáticas</h2><span class=\"ds-lvl\">Nivel 2</span></div><span class=\"ds-bar\"><span style=\"width:40%\"></span></span><p>4 de 10 temas en Competente o más</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-band{font-family:Figtree,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:grid;gap:.625rem;padding:1.25rem;border-radius:16px;background:#097d52;color:#fff}.ds-band-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem}.ds-band h2{margin:0;font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.15}.ds-lvl{padding:.25rem .75rem;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);font-size:.875rem;font-weight:700}.ds-bar{display:block;height:8px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.22);overflow:hidden}.ds-bar span{display:block;height:100%;background:#fff}.ds-band p{margin:0;font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Area Chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "plan-area-chip",
      "description": "Area picker on Aprende; the chosen chip fills with its area colour.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"true\" style=\"--area:#0a6fb0\">Ciencias</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"--area:#c2342a\">Lectura</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;gap:.5rem}.ds-chip{font-family:Figtree,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;min-height:2.75rem;padding:0 1rem;border:1px solid rgba(16,35,28,0.24);border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#10231c;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 140ms ease}.ds-chip::before{content:\"\";width:.5rem;height:.5rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--area)}.ds-chip:hover{background:#f4f9f6}.ds-chip[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--area);background:var(--area);color:#fff}.ds-chip[aria-pressed=\"true\"]::before{background:#fff}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #097d52;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Answer Option",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "plan-solve-option",
      "description": "Solve: a desk-coloured option; selected gets a 2px ink ring.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-opts\"><button class=\"ds-opt\"><span class=\"ds-let\">A</span>12 cm</button><button class=\"ds-opt is-selected\"><span class=\"ds-let\">B</span>18 cm</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-opts{display:grid;gap:9px}.ds-opt{font-family:Figtree,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;min-height:56px;padding:12px 14px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:#eef5f1;color:#10231c;font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:700;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:transform 100ms cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1),background-color 140ms ease;}.ds-opt:active{transform:scale(0.97)}.ds-opt:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #097d52;outline-offset:2px}.ds-let{display:grid;place-items:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;color:#08704a;font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:800}.ds-opt.is-selected{background:#fff;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px #10231c}.ds-opt.is-selected .ds-let{background:#10231c;color:#fff}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Guided Chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "plan-ask-chip",
      "description": "Guided path after a wrong answer: white chips on Green Black that turn yellow on press.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-ask\"><p class=\"ds-ask-p\">¿Qué pasa con el total si duplicas una parte?</p><button class=\"ds-ask-chip\">También se duplica</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-ask{font-family:Figtree,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:grid;gap:8px;padding:20px;background:#10231c;color:#fff}.ds-ask-p{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:1.375rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3}.ds-ask-chip{font-family:Figtree,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;width:100%;min-height:44px;padding:13px 15px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:#fff;color:#10231c;font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:transform 100ms cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1),background-color 140ms ease;}.ds-ask-chip:active{transform:scale(0.97);background:#ffd23f}.ds-ask-chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #ffd23f;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Cuaderno Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "notebook-button-primary",
      "description": "The notebook system primary, for teacher, school and staff.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-nb\">Guardar</button>",
      "css": ".ds-nb{font-family:\"Public Sans\",sans-serif;min-height:2.5rem;padding:.5rem 1.25rem;font-size:.9rem;background:#1d4f91;color:#fbfcfe;border:1px solid #1d4f91;border-radius:3px;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 140ms ease}.ds-nb:hover{background:#163f75;border-color:#163f75}.ds-nb:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1d4f91;outline-offset:2px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Plan de estudio",
    "overview": "Every screen answers three things in words: what to do now, why, and how each topic is going. Hoy is a plan, not a game board: a green card with the next step and its reason, one yellow button, then the rest of the day and the five areas with their level and bar. Aprende lists every topic of an area with its level and accuracy. Progress is named, never a numbered slot.\n\nDensity is low and the phone comes first: white cards on a pale green desk, one family of type, flat controls that answer a press with a small scale. The register is calm and credible, for students of 15 to 17 in short sessions and mixed light. It replaced the Álbum (sticker album) on 2026-11-10 because the metaphor read as unclear and decorative.\n\n**Review status.** This section records what the code ships. Signed-in screens were reviewed from component renders with fictional data, not live data; solve, review and Yo were not captured. Empty, long-label and real-volume states are unconfirmed on screen, and values may move after a live review.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "White cards on a pale green desk, 1px hairlines, 16px corners.",
      "Pitch green for the next-step card and the cover bars; one colour per area for its header band, dot and bar.",
      "Sticker yellow for the one primary action and the \"Siguiente\" tag.",
      "Figtree alone, 400 to 800, on seven type steps.",
      "Flat controls; a press is scale 0.97. One authored moment: the level-up flash on the reward."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Yellow Rule",
        "body": "One yellow control per screen: the primary action. Every other yellow is a mark that is never pressed.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Area Rule",
        "body": "An area's colour appears in three places only: the header band, the dot before its name, and its bar. Words on a band are white. A new area colour must hold 4.5:1 against white.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The One Family Rule",
        "body": "Figtree sets everything on a student screen, at 400 to 800. Hierarchy comes from the seven steps and weight, never from a second face, tracking or uppercase.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Press Rule",
        "body": "Nothing rests on a shadow and nothing leans. A press is `scale(0.97)` at 100ms `cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1)`, never a 3D edge or an offset shadow.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The One Moment Rule",
        "body": "A topic that went up on a fresh close settles in once: its row flashes from 55% yellow to soft green (520ms, after 250ms). It is the only celebration. Under reduced motion it does not play, and no press scales; colour changes stay.",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do set every student screen through these tokens, and add new student routes to `lib/student-look.ts`.",
      "Do give each screen one yellow primary action, and write the next step as a name with its reason, area and minutes.",
      "Do show every topic in a topic list with its MasteryBadge.",
      "Do use the area colour only as band, dot and bar, through `--area`.",
      "Do use 100ms strong ease-out for presses and 140ms for colour, and remove transforms and the level-up flash under reduced motion."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't show a numbered slot, sticker or tile without a name; progress is written in words.",
      "Don't make decoration look interactive: status facts on Hoy are plain icon and text, never pills or buttons.",
      "Don't add a second yellow control to a screen, or tilts, 3D press edges or resting shadows.",
      "Don't bring the notebook's ruling or red margin to student screens, or this look to teacher, school, staff, public or printed screens.",
      "Don't add a label line above a heading; the heading speaks.",
      "Don't hardcode the yellow, the ink or the area colours where a token exists."
    ]
  }
}
